   "text": "/execute in minecraft:the_nether at @s run tp @s ~ ~ ~",
   "sha256": "b1d4ec5df4308729a0f389e6d744a13bed8f70971bf27119ca94d57d7ea4c595",
   "i": 4989
  },
  {
   "ppr": {
    "ind": {
     "firstLine": "420"
    }
   },
   "c": [
    {
     "t": "你可以猜一猜，当你运行这两条指令时，效果分别是怎样的？",
     "p": {
      "font": {
       "hint": "eastAsia"
      }
     }
    }
   ],
   "text": "你可以猜一猜，当你运行这两条指令时，效果分别是怎样的？",
   "sha256": "691d07b48867223b52383c799ff392a4971d163508425110d9a238e2516272ab",
